-*   **Input:** An isovalue $\tau$ (default 0.5) [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Output:** A stream of triangles (vertices with position and normal) stored in an append buffer [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Output:** Draw arguments (vertex count) for indirect rendering [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Input:** A 3D density texture (`Texture3D`) of resolution $R \times R \times R$, where each voxel stores a scalar density value.
+*   **Output:** A mesh representing the isosurface, rendered via indirect draw calls.
 
